      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Page 3: Folio 1v, left side",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>reprehensible acts, and also [in red ink] the public acts of </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>ablution, obligatory prayer, </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>fasting, h\u0323ajj, alms,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>major ablution, washing in the prescribed manner, ablution with clean earth,</p>\n</li>\n\n\n<li>\n<p>[cleansing of] menstrual and vaginal discharge, buying </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and selling. Furthermore [in red ink], the statutes </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>of the shari\u0304\u02bfa are five [categories]: mandatory,\u00a0</p>\n</li></ol>\n\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
